\section{Uncertainty in RTL Code Generation w/ LLMs}
\label{sec:observation}

This section presents a set of key empirical observations that motivate our decoding strategy for RTL code generation with LLMs. Through comparative analysis with natural language (NL) generation and a corpus-level examination of RTL syntax patterns, we identify characteristic entropy dynamics and local context regularities that proves the need for a syntax-aware, temperature-adaptive decoding approach.

