scheduling algorithms that explicitly consider real-time constraints, which are explored in Section 5, and 2) scheduling
algorithms that implicitly consider real-time constraints, which are thoroughly covered in Section 6. A detailed summary
of the categorization and its subcategories is shown in Figure \ref{fig:GpuScheduling}.
