With this metric, observe that
$$
    \hodgestar \alpha = \hodgestar (1 \wedge \alpha) = \iota_{\alpha^\sharp} (\hodgestar 1) = {\iota_{{\alpha^\sharp}}} {(\alpha \wedge \omega)} = {\alpha({\alpha^{\sharp}})} \wedge \omega +  {\alpha}\wedge {\iota_{\alpha^\sharp}}\omega = \omega.
