\label{sec:sol}

\subsection{System Overview}
% The variability of information and complexity of text in threat reports necessitate substantial time investment and expertise from security teams to extract testflows. Currently, the process is largely manual and involves a detailed analysis of each report to understand the specific tactics and techniques used in different campaigns. This manual approach is not only time-consuming but also prone to human error.
% 
