Other reports, such as Mandiant \#2~\cite{googleblog2023} and Mandiant \#4~\cite{googleblogAPT41states} are shorter 9 pages each and often do not have the level of granularity required to produce comprehensive testflows. Consequently, the extracted testflows may be more general and tend to be redundant because of the small amount of usable detail.
