% \sol has proven to be an effective tool in automating the extraction of attack testflows from unstructured cyber threat reports. By leveraging language models and natural language processing techniques, \sol achieves high accuracy and efficiency, outperforming both manual methods and other automated solutions. This system significantly enhances the capabilities of SOC teams by providing structured and actionable testflows, enabling proactive threat hunting and incident response. The automation ensures consistency, reduces human error, and improves the overall security posture of organizations.
