 Suppose that $\phi$ has a satisfying assignment $\alpha: V_\phi \to \set{0, 1}$.
    We define a set of vertices in $\mathcal D_\phi$ using $\alpha$.
    We define $U = V(\mathcal D_\phi)$.
    If $\alpha(x_i) = 0$, we remove a vertex $x_i$ from $U$, otherwise
