    $\set{c_1, \ldots, c_m} \subseteq P$ and 
    $x_i \notin P$ or $\bar x_i \notin P$ for each $1\le i \le n$.
    We define an assignment $\alpha_P$ as follows: 
    $\alpha_P(x_i) = 1$ if $x_i \in P$ and
