We Implemented the hardware design using \texttt{SystemVerilog} and carried out simulation, synthesis, and implementation using \texttt{Xilinx Vivado 2019.2} \cite{vivado} . The target FPGA device is \texttt{XC7A200T-2FBG484I} \cite{yuanshen} . The project is \textbf{open-sourced} on GitHub to facilitate inspection and reuse by readers; the repository link is at \cite{myself}. Detailed resource utilization for each module is shown in Table \ref{tab:resource_utilization}. Area estimations without routing fabric are based on the parameters listed in Table \ref{tab:parameter_area_estim}, the parameters are calculated by counting the pixels as an example shown in Figure \ref{fig:primary_logic_unit}, and then scaling to the real FPGA size $23\times23 mm^2$ provided by Xilinx Documentation \cite{yuanshen}. An overview of the overall design is presented in Table \ref{tab:overall_info_impl}. 



