The AN was injected at the trusted multi-antenna AF relay for SISO in the presence of multiple single-antenna (MSA) Eves in \cite{relay10}. Assuming imperfect knowledge of the Eves' channels, the power of Alice, the AF relaying matrix, and the covariance of the AN transmitted by the relay were jointly optimized to maximize the received SINR of Bob under robust secrecy constraints. 
