\item Leveraging GenAI and learning analytics, \flora Engine delivers personalized scaffolds that dynamically support diverse learners throughout the SRL cycle.
\item The \flora Engine exemplifies the potential of AI-enhanced platforms to address the complexities of hybrid human–AI regulation in SRL, as demonstrated across multiple educational case studies.
\end{highlights}

